 cosmic-applets.spec | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/cosmic-applets.spec b/cosmic-applets.spec
index d670ca6..f55937a 100644
--- a/cosmic-applets.spec
+++ b/cosmic-applets.spec
